{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggzqCMM7roH9TedBvxjk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Floor 1 checks out: 40×20, four starts, one key and one door group, with the exit reachable only through the door. Next I'll check the Bullets API for built-in ricochet, pierce and lobbed arcs.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2264,"cache_read_input_tokens":319439,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2264},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01565e32-5dd5-4107-91e6-1b53667edea6","uuid":"935d5fa3-e39b-4f16-a99c-387cdabac3a0","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:14:44.241Z","request_id":"req_011CggzqC6iTJgGKnXWaT8hr","narration_block_indexes":[0],"thinking_duration_ms":1,"thinking_display":"updates"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CggzqCMM7roH9TedBvxjk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QTWDzdgoRVT1Xd2aqcFWJw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /home/micha/.cache/gauntlet-plan-research-x8cc180/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff && sed -n 1017,1046p API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-500","description":"Read the Bullets and SpatialHash API"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2264,"cache_read_input_tokens":319439,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2264},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01565e32-5dd5-4107-91e6-1b53667edea6","uuid":"32b5ce0e-773e-489f-a6f0-396fcfbe6676","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:14:44.242Z","request_id":"req_011CggzqC6iTJgGKnXWaT8hr","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01QTWDzdgoRVT1Xd2aqcFWJw":{"command":"cd /home/micha/.cache/gauntlet-plan-research-x8cc180/my-3d2dge/dist/handoff && sed -n 1017,1046p API-INDEX.md | cut -c1-500","description":"Read the Bullets and SpatialHash API"}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QTWDzdgoRVT1Xd2aqcFWJw","type":"tool_result","content":"## 18. Bullets\n\n- `new E.Bullets(game, o = {}) → shots`: new E.Bullets(game, { plane: 'ground' | 'side', max: 800, sparks: true }); game: its game\n- `shots.burst(base, vels)`: fire several at once from a pattern list of [vx, v2] (v2 = vy on the ground plane, vz in side view)\n- `shots.clear(team)`: remove every bullet, or only one team's\n- `shots.draw(r)`: queue them for drawing (glowing cores, or their sprites)\n- `shots.fire(b)`: fire one bullet. Fields: x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, r, dmg, life, team, color, core, sprite, pierce, grav, data\n- `shots.hit(targets, fn, team)`: test bullets of `team` against targets (objects with x, y, z and r, or w/h in side view). fn(bullet, target). Returns hits\n- `shots.update(dt, map)`: move them one step; with a map they stop at walls (a TileMap, or a PlatformMap in side views)\n- `shots.list = []`: the live bullets\n- `shots.max`: at most this many at once\n- `shots.plane`: 'ground' (they fly over x and y) or 'side' (x and z)\n- `shots.sparks`: a puff of sparks where one hits a wall\n- `E.pattern`: velocity helpers for bullet patterns. Angles in radians (0 = east / right). Each returns [vx, v2] or a list of them\n- `E.pattern.aim(a, b, speed)`: aim from a to b on the ground plane (x, y); aimSide uses x, z\n- `E.pattern.aimSide(a, b, speed)`: a velocity from a toward b in a side view (x, z)\n- `E.pattern.dir(angle, speed)`: one velocity at an angle\n- `E.pattern.ring(n, speed, offset = 0)`: n bullets in a full circle, rotated by offset\n- `E.pattern.spread(angle, n, arc, speed)`: n bullets fanned across `arc` radians around `angle`\n\n## 19. Spatial hash\n\n- `new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32) → grid`: new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32): buckets things by position, to find what is near cheaply; map: the buckets\n- `grid.add(o, x = o.x, y = o.y)`: put o in the bucket at (x, y)\n- `grid.build(list, xk = 'x', yk = 'y')`: clear, then add every live thing in list (skips o.dead); do it once a step\n- `grid.clear()`: empty it\n- `grid.near(x, y, r, fn)`: call fn(o) for everything in the cells touching the circle (check the exact distance yourself)\n- `grid.query(x, y, r)`: what lies within about r of (x, y), as a list (near() calls a function instead)\n- `grid.cell`: new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32): buckets things by position, to find what is near cheaply. cell: the bucket size in world units; map: the buckets\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174804__x8cc180/work","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01565e32-5dd5-4107-91e6-1b53667edea6","uuid":"51ce0465-61ff-445d-b4c3-192b13334c45","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:14:44.263Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"## 18. Bullets\n\n- `new E.Bullets(game, o = {}) → shots`: new E.Bullets(game, { plane: 'ground' | 'side', max: 800, sparks: true }); game: its game\n- `shots.burst(base, vels)`: fire several at once from a pattern list of [vx, v2] (v2 = vy on the ground plane, vz in side view)\n- `shots.clear(team)`: remove every bullet, or only one team's\n- `shots.draw(r)`: queue them for drawing (glowing cores, or their sprites)\n- `shots.fire(b)`: fire one bullet. Fields: x, y, z, vx, vy, vz, r, dmg, life, team, color, core, sprite, pierce, grav, data\n- `shots.hit(targets, fn, team)`: test bullets of `team` against targets (objects with x, y, z and r, or w/h in side view). fn(bullet, target). Returns hits\n- `shots.update(dt, map)`: move them one step; with a map they stop at walls (a TileMap, or a PlatformMap in side views)\n- `shots.list = []`: the live bullets\n- `shots.max`: at most this many at once\n- `shots.plane`: 'ground' (they fly over x and y) or 'side' (x and z)\n- `shots.sparks`: a puff of sparks where one hits a wall\n- `E.pattern`: velocity helpers for bullet patterns. Angles in radians (0 = east / right). Each returns [vx, v2] or a list of them\n- `E.pattern.aim(a, b, speed)`: aim from a to b on the ground plane (x, y); aimSide uses x, z\n- `E.pattern.aimSide(a, b, speed)`: a velocity from a toward b in a side view (x, z)\n- `E.pattern.dir(angle, speed)`: one velocity at an angle\n- `E.pattern.ring(n, speed, offset = 0)`: n bullets in a full circle, rotated by offset\n- `E.pattern.spread(angle, n, arc, speed)`: n bullets fanned across `arc` radians around `angle`\n\n## 19. Spatial hash\n\n- `new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32) → grid`: new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32): buckets things by position, to find what is near cheaply; map: the buckets\n- `grid.add(o, x = o.x, y = o.y)`: put o in the bucket at (x, y)\n- `grid.build(list, xk = 'x', yk = 'y')`: clear, then add every live thing in list (skips o.dead); do it once a step\n- `grid.clear()`: empty it\n- `grid.near(x, y, r, fn)`: call fn(o) for everything in the cells touching the circle (check the exact distance yourself)\n- `grid.query(x, y, r)`: what lies within about r of (x, y), as a list (near() calls a function instead)\n- `grid.cell`: new E.SpatialHash(cell = 32): buckets things by position, to find what is near cheaply. cell: the bucket size in world units; map: the buckets","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /home/micha/dev/cc-matrix/runs/claude-opus-5-5-max.plan__20261103-174804__x8cc180/work","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01QTWDzdgoRVT1Xd2aqcFWJw","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
