is not seeded; `AIHub.rng(label)` is the same on every copy. The harness: `?game=&players=&auto=1`, plus `latency`, `jitter`, `loss`, `scenario=host-leave|server`; pass is `window.__hubCheck.pass`, completion `document.body.dataset.complete === 'true'`; it must be served from the same origin as the game.\n","numLines":130,"startLine":898,"totalLines":1027}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VBWFJXs9of4hbqc5kv1Tbw","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
